    affiliation: Faculté des Sciences et Ingénierie, Sorbonne Université


keywords:
  - multi-agent systems
  - large language models
  - forecasting
  - probabilistic calibration
  - benchmark
  - LLM-as-a-judge
  - evaluator reliability
  - social simulation
  - reproducibility

